				<u>IG</u>
				22.43<i>A</i>27
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πληγάς τινι</span>
			<i>excuse</i> him a flogging, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				1426
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ὅρκον</span> Jusj. in
