			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.95
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>neglect,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ θ&lt;&gt;<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εῖα</span></span>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				1537
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν καιρόν</span>”
